  "description": "The open-ocean depth zone — high pressure, low light, slow movement. Multiple solitons at minimum velocity, wide width, high dissipation. The acoustic signature of the deep ocean column: signal arrives late, attenuated, shifted in spectrum by the medium. The water itself as the instrument.",
